{
  "summary": "This synthetic Commissioner's Bulletin temporarily modifies Texas residential property declination reporting so Reason Code L (\u201cCredit or insurance score\u201d) may be used as the sole declination reason during qualifying state-declared catastrophe periods. The modification applies to declination notices with notification dates on or after January 1, 2027, sets the Reason Code L companion_required constraint to FALSE, leaves Code J\u2019s must_appear_alone rule unchanged, and sunsets on December 31, 2027 unless extended.",
